# Sample .gitignore for .booth/shared/home/coder/Desktop/
# Copy here when committing team desktop icons with +desktop-icons-shared.
#
# Deny-all is deliberate. Launchers the booth image ships (code.desktop,
# firefox.desktop, google-chrome.desktop, viewmd-web.desktop, …) are re-seeded
# from /etc/skel/Desktop on every start, and that seed is NO-CLOBBER: once a
# copy is committed here, the image's own updated version can never replace it.
# Commit only launchers your team wrote, and let the image own the rest.

*
!.gitignore
!.mount-this

# Un-ignore your own launchers explicitly, e.g.:
# !team-runbook.desktop
# !staging-console.desktop
